{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "池中不受落葉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嵓影入池無火厄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時濬池得二物"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昔有印月亭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊有臨雲閣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塔係唐秘書萬齊融所建，璿師經行其下，影與塔齊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師出方丈佛誦起，至回已畢，人不信命八十一人同\n誦有聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西崖有佛跡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "崖有坐禪石"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西有祖印嵓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後有盋盂峯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玲瓏嵓下有亭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王荊公有詩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後山鳴，客至；東鳴，齋主來；西鳴，病僧亡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長庚旁有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在寺東多核桃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺西有問水石，下有活眼泉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "小白塔下名散花岡，心鏡禪師建塔施食，饅頭\n化為石。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "張狀元同大慧杲訪宏智覺嶺上，遜之不已，張公名其亭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昔有涵虛閣禪師修道其\n中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東谷有荷池"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前山有凰下溪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋時跡在路"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鍋從天台聖僧送來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "池上有宿鷺亭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "松行有隱蓋亭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傑祖塔于青鳳山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夢堂有賦，高元之跋語，今存殘碣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傑祖遺偈，立石於菴，成殘碣。今重刊于祖堂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "左菴良侍奉實菴茂于軒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清關橋上有紅荳崖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "小白嶺上多小白花故名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應菴塔院名堆雲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伏翠今存南嶴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塔在山頂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "袁文清銘云建于清風塢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蔣摩訶、布帒和上之徒，塔于盤山寺，有盤山莊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛隴寺，唐時咸啟禪師所建。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梅屋春樂軒，先賢植梅處。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太白山後有鬼谷祠，葛仙翁訪之，有\n詩。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐杜雍避裘甫之亂，棄子負母隱此。徵之不起，歿而祀焉。"}
